# Aladdin knocked back on level 5 (PlayerKnockback, $81:DADD): falling,
# it tests the ground behind him for behaviour bit 4 ($81:DB68) and, on
# it, sets V_1A10 and V_1A12 ($81:DB72). No script is hurt on level 5.
# Stage a1 s1 (level 5) as rand_stage_a1_s1's first 9 lines, then walking
# right off the ledge into the fall, where PlayerAir finds that ground
# from y $01DC down. 1. 30 frames into the fall (y $01BE) his code is set
# to PlayerKnockback's entry (the record's P, PC: $30, $DADD), as the
# actor loop resumes it: thrown back onto the ledge, the test finds no bit
# 4. 2. 45 frames in (y $0208): he falls back through that ground.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
hold Y+RIGHT 23
hold RIGHT 13
hold LEFT 50
hold DOWN+A 31
hold B+R 57
hold RIGHT 74
hold Y+LEFT 19
hold L 84
hold RIGHT 30
poke $0008DD 30,DD,DA
wait 60
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
hold Y+RIGHT 23
hold RIGHT 13
hold LEFT 50
hold DOWN+A 31
hold B+R 57
hold RIGHT 74
hold Y+LEFT 19
hold L 84
hold RIGHT 45
poke $0008DD 30,DD,DA
wait 60
